<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus seeks tenders for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus seeks tenders for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it invited tenders by October 29 for one cargo of 25,000 tonnes of feed barley, with shipment from Europe between November 20 and December 5 and from North America between November 10 and 25.</p>
</text>
